    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-contract-position",
        "moduleId": "contract-position",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定位：三值比较",
        "markdown": "教材把 `int compareTo(T obj)` 放在 **Collections Framework** 的语境中：它不满足于回答两个对象是否相等，而是给出“较小、相同、较大”三种结果。正因为比较结果带有方向，它才能直接用于排序。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000121"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "int compareTo(T obj);"
              ],
              "lineStart": 693,
              "lineEnd": 701,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "98823ee42a642ac5a1087e2f5595a8df483ce483044c270f59f06cb541b84388"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-three-way-why",
        "moduleId": "contract-position",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：为什么排序需要三值结果",
        "markdown": "布尔比较只有两种结果：相等或不相等。排序却还要回答“谁排在前面”，因此比较方法至少要提供三种可区分的输出。`compareTo` 用返回值的符号承担这一职责，就像天平可以显示左重、平衡、右重三个方向，而不只是“两边一样重吗”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-contract-position"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-sign-rule",
        "moduleId": "sign-convention",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "教材约定：返回值 r 的三种含义",
        "markdown": "教材给出的返回值是一个整数 $r$：\n\n| 返回值 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| $r < 0$ | 当前对象小于参数 `obj` |\n| $r == 0$ | 当前对象等于参数 `obj` |\n| $r > 0$ | 当前对象大于参数 `obj` |\n\n调用 `a.compareTo(b)` 时，负值表示 `a` 应排在 `b` 之前，正值表示 `a` 应排在 `b` 之后。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000121"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "int compareTo(T obj);"
              ],
              "lineStart": 693,
              "lineEnd": 701,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "98823ee42a642ac5a1087e2f5595a8df483ce483044c270f59f06cb541b84388"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-sign-not-value",
        "moduleId": "sign-convention",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：只约束符号，不约束具体数值",
        "markdown": "契约只约束**符号**，并不规定具体数值。返回 `-1`、`0`、`1` 是最常见的实现方式，但返回 `-42` 或 `7` 同样合法，只要符号正确。实现时还应保证方向自洽：若 `a.compareTo(b)` 返回负值，则 `b.compareTo(a)` 应返回正值，即两者的符号相反；对象与自身比较应返回 $0$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-sign-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-misconception",
        "moduleId": "sign-convention",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "模型补充：两个常见误解",
        "markdown": "常见误解之一是把 `compareTo` 当成返回 true/false 的相等判断。它返回整数，`0` 只表示“在比较意义上相同”，并不说明两个变量指向同一个对象。另一个误解是认为返回值必须是 `-1`、`0`、`1`；实际上契约只区分负、零、正三个区间。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-sign-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-consistency-with-equals",
        "moduleId": "equals-consistency",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "模型补充：与 equals 保持一致",
        "markdown": "Java 的 `Comparable` 文档强烈建议（但不是编译器强制要求）让 `compareTo` 与 `equals` 保持一致：`x.compareTo(y) == 0` 应当与 `x.equals(y)` 结果相同。\n\n若二者不一致，依赖自然顺序的集合（如 `TreeSet`、`TreeMap`）会把 compareTo 为 $0$ 的两个对象当作同一个键，从而只保留其中一个，即使 `equals` 认为它们不同。`BigDecimal` 是经典反例：`1.0` 与 `1.00` 的 `compareTo` 为 $0$，`equals` 却为 false。因此为自定义类实现自然排序时，应让两个判断基于同一组关键字段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-sign-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-sorting-purpose",
        "moduleId": "sorting-application",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "教材衔接：用于排序",
        "markdown": "教材指出三值比较的用途是**排序**：返回的“小 / 同 / 大”正好对应排序算法所需的先后关系。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
